    "note": "There were NO table grants at all until 2026-08-05, so every query by the runtime role would have failed with permission denied - and verify_invariants.sql would still have printed all-green, because it only ever checked what the role CANNOT do. RLS narrows a grant; with no grant it was protecting a door already welded shut.",
    "schema_usage": [
